# Core hours

Core working hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026 [[cite:obs-7b98c4bcf2465ab320c11ebcb72be6c51289310d "Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026."]].

Where the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies [[cite:obs-7b98c4bcf2465ab320c11ebcb72be6c51289310d "Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026."]].
